#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:242
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_GetAMoveOn"
msgid ""
"Hey, hey!\n"
"Get a move on!$"
msgstr ""
"喂，喂！\n"
"快点！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:246
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_NolandImFactoryHead"
msgid ""
"Hey, my name's NOLAND!\n"
"I'm basically in charge of this place,\l"
"which is why I'm the FACTORY HEAD!\p"
"I had a look at your Battle Swap data.\p"
"You seem to have the right idea,\n"
"but you're still square in your head!\p"
"Listen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only\n"
"about reading books or doing desk work.\p"
"Just doing that sort of thing…\n"
"It may as well be useless!\p"
"You have to experience things with\n"
"your heart and your body, understand?\p"
"I'll take you on under the same\n"
"conditions as you.\p"
"I'll be using rental POKéMON, too!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿，我叫诺兰德！\n"
"这里基本上归我管，\l"
"所以我是工厂主管！\p"
"我看过你的交换对战数据了。\p"
"你的思路好像没错，\n"
"但脑袋还是太死板了！\p"
"听好了，知识可不只是\n"
"读读书、做做案头工作。\p"
"只做那些事……\n"
"跟没做也差不多！\p"
"你得用你的心和身体去体验，\n"
"明白吗？\p"
"我会在和你相同的条件下\n"
"跟你对战。\p"
"我也会使用租借宝可梦！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:263
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_ShakeOutKnowledgeBringItOn"
msgid ""
"Shake out every last bit of your\n"
"knowledge and bring it on!$"
msgstr ""
"把你的知识全都抖出来，\n"
"放马过来吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:267
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_NolandLetsSeeFrontierPass"
msgid ""
"NOLAND: Smart going!\n"
"Let's see your FRONTIER PASS.$"
msgstr ""
"诺兰德：真聪明！\n"
"给我看看你的开拓通行证。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:271
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_ReceivedKnowledgeSymbol"
msgid ""
"The Knowledge Symbol was embossed\n"
"on the FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""
"开拓通行证上\n"
"印上了知识标志！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:275
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_NextTimeNoHoldsBarred"
msgid ""
"Heh…\n"
"You're a pretty bright spark…\p"
"Next time, I'll come after you hard.\n"
"No holds barred, understand?\p"
"You keep up your studies!$"
msgstr ""
"嘿……\n"
"你真是个机灵的家伙……\p"
"下次我会全力对付你。\n"
"不留任何余地，明白吗？\p"
"你要继续好好学习哦！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:282
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_HarderLookThanLastTime"
msgid ""
"NOLAND: Hey, hey! How's it going?\n"
"You keeping up with your studies?\p"
"…Oh?\p"
"You've taken on a harder look than\n"
"the last time I saw you.\p"
"Now, this should be fun!\n"
"I'm getting excited, hey!$"
msgstr ""
"诺兰德：嘿，嘿！最近怎么样？\n"
"有没有继续好好学习？\p"
"……哦？\p"
"你的眼神比我上次见你的时候\n"
"更锐利了。\p"
"这下可有意思了！\n"
"我兴奋起来了，嘿！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:291
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_AllRightBringItOn"
msgid ""
"All right!\n"
"Bring it on!$"
msgstr ""
"好！\n"
"放马过来吧！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:295
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_OutOfMyLeagueLetsSeePass"
msgid ""
"NOLAND: What the…\n"
"You're getting out of my league!\p"
"Sheesh!\n"
"Let's see that FRONTIER PASS!$"
msgstr ""
"诺兰德：搞什么……\n"
"你已经超出我的水平了！\p"
"真是的！\n"
"给我看看那张开拓通行证！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:301
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_KnowledgeSymbolTookGoldenShine"
msgid ""
"The Knowledge Symbol took on\n"
"a golden shine!$"
msgstr ""
"知识标志\n"
"发出了金色的光芒！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom/scripts.inc:305
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleFactoryBattleRoom_Text_LastTimeILoseToYou"
msgid ""
"Pfft, man!\p"
"That's absolutely the last time\n"
"I lose to you!\p"
"We have to do this again, hey?$"
msgstr ""
"切，可恶！\p"
"这绝对是我最后一次\n"
"输给你了！\p"
"我们一定要再比一次，嘿？$"
